fonts-nerd-fonts (3.5.1-1) focal; urgency=medium

  [ rego-port-bot ]
  * New upstream release 3.5.1
  * Package only the families Regolith uses (BitstreamVeraSansMono, Cousine,
    DejaVuSansMono, Hack, Meslo, Mononoki, RobotoMono and SourceCodePro), in
    their Nerd Font and Nerd Font Mono variants, plus the new
    fonts-nerd-font-symbols; stop building the other fonts-nerd-font-*
    packages
  * Alias the families Nerd Fonts 3 renamed with fontconfig:
    BitstreamVeraSansMono Nerd Font (now BitstromWera Nerd Font) and
    DejaVuSansMono Nerd Font (now DejaVuSansM Nerd Font)
  * Break the Regolith looks and the updates blocklet that still use the
    legacy Material Design code points (U+F500-U+FD46) Nerd Fonts 3 dropped

